# Toy scenario of the golden step's user-content control (plan 07-10, D-31): it names an operator image
# (`content exec user`) but its toy inventory row says `run`, not `skip-ok`, so the gate would treat it as an
# ordinary test that needs an image it never has. It has no golden and no report; only the inventory rule sees it.
ivss 1
id toy-user
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec user
content grom zero-grom
run-to 100 cpu-cycles stop halted
